# On hex-next, a session's Steps page leads with its Messages, which open its thread with a box
# that writes into the session, over invented answers:
# ANSWERS=scripts/duo-sessions.json HEX=kept scripts/duo tap <ref> scripts/duo-session-chat-taps
launch hexvoice:///?tasks
wait 3
tap Weekend trip, idle
wait 2
shoot steps
tap Weekend trip. Opens its messages
wait 2
shoot thread
type thread-input typed
above-keyboard thread-input
shoot typing
